type: software
title: "FlakyDetector: static test-risk analysis and pytest execution evidence"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alimpiev"
    given-names: "Artem"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6740-7242"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.1rc1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Artem7898/flakydetector"
url: "https://github.com/Artem7898/flakydetector"
abstract: >-
  A Python toolkit for explainable static test-risk analysis, attributable
  evidence, and comparable pytest execution observations. Static risks are
  not proof of intermittent failure. This version is a release candidate.
keywords:
  - python
  - pytest
  - static-analysis
  - flaky-tests
  - reproducibility
